description	"Sidon Ithano aka the 'Crimson Corsair'

A mobile pirate hybrid with a Grappling Hook, feared for his talents.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Conqueror's Vibrocutlass (Yellow/Cyan)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Block
-- 18% more knockback
-- 16% less Yellow damage
-- 35% shorter
- Buccaneer's Blaster Pistol (3)
-- 10% more charged FP drain
- Frag Grenade (2)
-- Burns on det

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (3)
- Armor Regen (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- BP-Free Jumps

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS3]
- Grappling Hook/Hop (2) ^3[Melee CS4]
-- Pulls/staggers on hit"